ASoC: dt-bindings: qcom,sm8250: add Xiaomi Marble sound card

The Xiaomi Poco F5 / Redmi Note 12 Turbo (marble) card is an SM8450
compatible card whose tertiary TDM speaker interface needs an LPASS core
vote while it runs. Add its compatible and the optional "tdm-vote"
clock.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Source-commit: b38dc3e3c80b559c39f229d7825f55fc39018846
Source-author: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Source-date: 2026-10-25T09:49:34+08:00
